To solve this problem we use 
Fast and Slow pointers for --> Optimal approach TC:O(N) SC:O(1)
Count Zeroes + ReWrite for --> Better approach TC:O(N) SC:O(1)
Extra Array for --> Brute Force approach TC:O(N) SC:O(N)

BRUTE:
--------
n=list(map(int,input().split()))
result=[]
for num in n:
    if num!=0:
       result.append(num)
while len(result) < len(n):
    result.append(0)
print(result)

BETTER:
------------
arr = list(map(int, input().split()))
pos = 0
for num in arr:
    if num != 0:
        arr[pos] = num
        pos += 1
while pos < len(arr):
    arr[pos] = 0
    pos += 1
print(arr)

OPTIMAL
---------------
arr = list(map(int, input().split()))
i = 0
j = 0
while j < len(arr):
    if arr[j] == 0:
        j += 1
    else:
        arr[i], arr[j] = arr[j], arr[i]
        i += 1
        j += 1
print(arr)
